#: ../../source/github-slugger_README.md:11
msgid ""
"Generate a slug just like GitHub does for markdown headings. It also "
"ensures slugs are unique in the same way GitHub does it. The overall goal"
" of this package is to emulate the way GitHub handles generating markdown"
" heading anchors as close as possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/github-slugger_README.md:13
msgid ""
"This project is not a Markdown or HTML parser: passing `alpha *bravo* "
"charlie` or `alpha <em>bravo</em> charlie` doesn’t work. Instead pass the"
" plain text value of the heading: `alpha bravo charlie`."
msgstr ""

